	"data": "NAIST — CARE Lab (Cybernetics and Reality Engineering)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nThe Nara Institute of Science and Technology (NAIST) CARE Lab, led by Prof. Kiyoshi Kiyokawa, is the top-pick program for XR and spatial computing research. The lab's \"personalized reality\" concept maps directly to ThoughtBubbles — spatial thought organization, graph…",
